<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-012" chapter-id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying" source-id="s-nanshi-012-ruanlingying-ws2060595">
  <p id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">文宣阮太后諱<persName id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying:p001:m0006" ref="8dg_6jb_3j5_A">令嬴</persName>，會稽余姚人也。本姓石。初，齊始安王<persName id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying:p001:m0026" ref="98q_mll_d6v_AA">遙光</persName>納焉。<persName id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying:p001:m0031" ref="98q_mll_d6v_AA">遙光</persName>敗，入東昏宮。建康城平，為武帝采女。在孕，夢龍罩其床。天監七年八月，生元帝于後宮。是日大赦。尋拜為修容，賜姓阮氏。嘗隨元帝出藩。大同九年六月，薨于江州正寢，時年六十七。其年十一月，歸葬江寧縣通望山，諡曰宣。元帝即位，有司奏追崇為文宣太后，還祔小廟。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">承聖二年，追贈太后父齊故奉朝請<persName id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying:p002:m0015" ref="8dg_6jb_3j5">石靈寶</persName>散騎常侍、左衛將軍、封武康縣侯，母<persName id="c-nanshi-012-ruanlingying:p002:m0035" ref="jqb_32a_0p0">陳氏</persName>武康侯夫人。</p>
</text>
